#doc (Manual) "Proof tree appendix" =>

# Appendix: Proof Tree Documentation

The proof-tree documentation is part of the Infomaterial manual.

Its source tree is `docs/verso/mark/`.
When the public documentation site is assembled, that tree is mounted inside the
manual appendix at `manual/appendix/mark/`.

Verso is the traversal spine.
The `mark` tree is the proof-tree body that the spine appends and unfolds.
